    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's (AKU) School of Nursing and Midwifery (SONAM), Pakistan, has joined forces with leading academic institutions across Pakistan to launch the National Consortium for Nursing and Midwifery Excellence. This alliance is aimed at strengthening collective advocacy, academic excellence, and professional visibility for nurses and midwives nationwide.",
